  "description": "Pipeline converting human-editable per-class metadata CSVs into validated, schema.org-aligned JSON-LD for the MARCO-BOLO metadata catalog. Driven by make and run in Docker, so it executes locally or in CI. Validates CSV-W constraints, manual foreign key constraints and SHACL shapes before conversion.",
